    <comment>English: Baud, data bits, parity, stop bits, handshake, DTR, RTS, RX ending, and encoding apply on the next connection. Terminal / HEX mode, HEX timeout, TX ending, and disconnect confirmation apply immediately without disconnecting the active port.</comment>
