    <comment>English: Default 40 ms. Choose: longest gap inside one packet &lt; HEX timeout &lt; shortest gap between packets. If FTDI splits one packet into 15–30 ms chunks, keep this timeout above that gap or review Device Manager &gt; Latency Timer (advanced: 2 ms).</comment>
